SUMMARY:Chicken Run (2000)
LOCATION:Academy Theater\, 7818 SE Stark St\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5191;-122.5829
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Peter Lord · 84 min\n\nThe creators of Wallace & Gromit b
 ring you an exciting and original story about a group of chickens determin
 ed to fly the coop–even if they can’t fly! It’s hardly poultry in mo
 tion when Rocky attempts to teach Ginger and her feathered friends to fly
 …but\, with teamwork\, determination and a little bit o’ cluck\, the f
 earless flock plots one last attempt in a spectacular bid for freedom.\n\n
